    <ol:summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">User-authorized git push succeeded. git ls-remote independently confirmed origin/main=2c8481f696b9efee258a8a007bbfa01c85f1994b. Complete local skills, original distribution snapshots, knowledge.owl, durable records/proofs and agent instructions were included. Clean-clone validation passed. This receipt is a follow-up commit; future agents should pull the latest main.</ol:summary>
