    <ol:summary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Documented historical implementation: [1.3.1] - 2026-11-15; Fixed; CHANGELOG.md:10. DONE accepts retrospective import/provenance only; current behavior is covered only where a named test exists. Original execution receipts unavailable.</ol:summary>
    <ol:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Android lists available bundled fonts and the system default instead of unavailable desktop font families.</ol:title>
