    <ol:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">New and Close document actions clear the current draft and undo history after confirming unsaved changes. Deliberately closed Android documents stay closed after restarting, and consumed file/share intents are not replayed on Activity recreation.</ol:title>
